{
  "description": "Demographic transition model engine — stages 1-5 redraw piecewise birth/death rate curves on a math-canvas; the learner pages through stages and drives birth/death rate sliders to reproduce each stage's target rates within a tolerance. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
